    <briefdescription>
<para>Receives debug output from the target process via dbgeng. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Registered with IDebugClient5::SetOutputCallbacks. Implements IDebugOutputCallbacks2 because dbgeng routes output through Output2 when the callback object QIs for IDebugOutputCallbacks2.</para>
<para>When the target writes to OutputDebugString, Output2 is called with DEBUG_OUTCBI_DML or DEBUG_OUTCBI_ANY_FORMAT. The text is forwarded to <ref refid="classdebug_1_1_state_1a75eddef264990eb7abd182485ea3de46" kindref="member">State::debuggeeOutputText</ref> and <ref refid="classdebug_1_1_state_1ae4bd04e1fd7930cad73dece33f9d2109" kindref="member">State::hasDebuggeeOutput</ref> is set so that the main loop can emit a DAP output event.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Registered and unregistered by <ref refid="classdebug_1_1_session_1a9df5578465f53196e5db144251931a86" kindref="member">Session::initialize</ref> and <ref refid="classdebug_1_1_session_1aae0c1bb004a500bd33192d03ac7f63b9" kindref="member">Session::shutdown</ref>. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
